      "description": "We are experiencing persistent issues with our SSO integration for users in the Middle East production environment. Approximately 19 users are unable to log in. The specific symptoms are: 1) When attempting to authenticate, the system rejects the valid MFA codes sent to their devices. 2) If they bypass the MFA prompt (or if it doesn't appear), they get stuck in a redirect loop between our login page and the Identity Provider, never reaching the application dashboard. This started happening suddenly this morning. Please investigate the authentication flow and MFA validation logic."
